[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the NDK module only.  It does not
install a loadable module, and installing it alongside nginx does not
add anything to a running server.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build
www/nginx, www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the DEVEL_KIT option
enabled, or with any option that depends on it.  Those ports pick the
sources up from %%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-ndk and
produce ndk_http_module.so.
EOM
}
]
